To install numberlink directly:

    $ go install github.com/thomasahle/numberlink@latest

Or build from source:

    $ git clone https://github.com/thomasahle/numberlink
    $ cd numberlink
    $ go build
    $ ./numberlink

Run tests with:

    $ go test ./...


If you don't have Go, you can download it from:

    https://go.dev/dl/

On Ubuntu/Debian:

    $ sudo apt-get install golang

On macOS with Homebrew:

    $ brew install go
